       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_quiz_k8s_151'), 3, 'Read `lastState.terminated` of the restarted container: the reason and the exit code. 137 is 128 + 9: which signal is 9, and who sends it when a cgroup''s memory is full?');
