       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_coding_k8s_172'), 2, 'Look at the listener fields `protocol`, `port` and `tls.certificateRefs`, the HTTPRoute `matches[].path` types `PathPrefix` and `Exact`, the filters `RequestRedirect` and `URLRewrite` (`ReplacePrefixMatch`), and `backendRefs[].port`.'),
       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_coding_k8s_172'), 3, 'A route that sends `/static` and everything below it to a Service `cdn` on port 8080 without the `/static` part: `matches: [{ path: { type: PathPrefix, value: /static } }]`, `filters: [{ type: URLRewrite, urlRewrite: { path: { type: ReplacePrefixMatch, replacePrefixMatch: / } } }]`, `backendRefs: [{ name: cdn, port: 8080 }]`.');
